" >Special upgrades and companions — unlock tools, weapons, and allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of enemies and epic bosses — each with unique behaviours to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decision-making and strategy — every run forces tough choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability — new treasures and dangers each time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232380/extras/fc6fbf3bd01b6f937cad23c8480a146f.poster.avif?t=1785184897\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232380/extras/fc6fbf3bd01b6f937cad23c8480a146f.webm?t=1785184897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232380/extras/fc6fbf3bd01b6f937cad23c8480a146f.mp4?t=1785184897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A survival roguelike where a frog digs through freezing snow, uncovers treasures, unlocks upgrades, and battles mystical creatures. Find the escape door — or defeat the final boss to survive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232380/eabf0845d0ecf61008e3033c1f8197990c09c1d3/header.jpg?t=1785184897", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item